  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, cuphead.apworld will be
    installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago Launcher
    directory. BepInEx will then be downloaded into the game's core folder. The AP
    Mod folder will be installed inside the BepInEx\plugins directory.
