  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, once in the main menu you should be able to
    see a ''Mods'' button, press it and then enable the ''bo3_archipelago'' mod.
    Now that it has been enabled, go to ''Zombies'' and a new ''Archipelago'' button
    should be there.


    In the "Server Name" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed
    by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after
    creating a new room.


    In "Slot Name", enter the name assigned to your YAML
    file.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave
    it blank.


    Finally, click "Test Connection" on the bottom and once you''re
    connect, you can start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
