  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, launch ''PlantsVsZombies.exe'' inside the ''Archipelago''
    folder (you can do it automatically by toggling launch after setup). Once in
    the main menu, click the ''Start Adventure'' button.


    In the "Host and Port"
    field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that
    you can find on the website after creating a new room.


    In "Slot Name",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional.
    If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click "Connect To
    Archipelago" and then, you can start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
