  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new window should appear on game launch.


    In
    "Username" enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    Type ''archipelago.gg''
    in the "Server IP" field.


    In "Port", enter the room''s port which is a
    5-digit number that can be found on the website after opening a room.


    The
    "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally,
    click "Connect" and start running!'
