      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Hi-Fi RUSH is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file
    (hi_fi_rush.apworld). When "hi_fi_rush.apworld" is downloaded in the Archipelago
    Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to
    "Options Creator" to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send
    it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
