  m_text: "When you click \"START SETUP\" in the \"SETUP\" tab, Raft Mod Loader will
    be installed into the Raft core files, along with the required mods, which will
    be placed in Raft\\mods. \n\nIf you have launch after setup toggle on, it will
    boot-up \"RMLLauncher.exe\", all you'll need to do, is click 'Play' to launch
    the game with mods loaded."
