  m_text: "If you launch the Mod Launcher for the first time with the launch option
    related to it and it says that some framework or mods are required, it shouldn't
    do anything and I would assume it is just a false error (seems like it).\n\nIf
    you game doesn't launch with the AP Mod loaded when using the Client, open the
    Mod Launcher and make sure the 'Archipelago' mod is enabled.\n\nFeel free to
    report anything (or simply join the discord) here!\n\t"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
