  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, the OC2 Modding folder
    used for the Archipelago will be installed into the Overcooked 2 directory. If
    the "Launch Installation after setup" toggle is enabled, 'oc2-modding-install.bat'
    will start after setup, it will install all required files into the game's folder.
