  m_text: 'ALL THE DOWNLOADED APPS CAN BE FOUND ON YOUR MAIN DRIVE, INSIDE ''DOCUMENTS''.

    IF
    YOU HAVE THE START AFTER SETUP TOGGLE ON, BOTH APPS WILL START UP UPON INSTALLATION.

    IF
    YOU DO SETUP WITH THIS TOGGLE ON DO NOT CLOSE THE MSYS INSTALLER UNTIL YOU ARE
    DONE AND HAVE FINISHED THE INSTALLATION.

    ALSO PLEASE, WHEN INTALLING MSYS
    WITH ITS INSTALLER, INSTALL IT AT ITS DEFAULT INSTALLATION PATH AND DO NOT MOVE
    IT AFTERWARDS.

    SAME WITH THE AP LAUNCHER, DO NOT MOVE IT.'
