  m_text: "You have 2 revert options, both can't be enabled at the same time.\n\nIf
    you use the \"Clear AP Mods\" option it will only delete the mods that are required
    for Neon White Archipelago.\n\nIf you use the \"Full Clear MelonLoader\" option
    it will delete everything related to MelonLoader and mods. If other mods are
    detected an additionnal confirmation will appear.\n\t"
