  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'I WOULD HIGHLY RECOMMEND LEAVING START APPS AFTER SETUP ON!


    Once
    everything is set up, in ''MSYS2 Setup'', click ''next'' then, download it in
    the default download path. Once MSYS finished downloading, go back to the tool
    and click ''DL DEPENDENCIES'' on the "Setup" tab.


    On the SM64 AP Launcher,
    click "Compile default SM64AP build (or ''Show advanced options'' then "Compile
    custom build if you prefer).

    Doing that, a new "Build Configurator" window
    should open and in there, press ''Browse...'' and select the directory where
    your build will be located. In the input field below, enter the name of the build
    (call it whatever you want). Finally, you can click ''Download Files''.

    When
    it''s done, you can select the region, make flags and apply patches. Once you''re
    done, you can ''Create Build''.


    When the build is created, go back to the
    Launcher''s ''Main Window'' and you''ll see the new build in "Playable builds".
    Select it and before starting, in ''Launch Options''.


    Replace "NAME" by
    the name assigned to your YAML file.


    Replace ''PORT'' with the port, it
    is a 5-digit number that can be found the Archipelago website after opening a
    new room.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one,
    leave it to default value.


    Finally, you can click ''Play selected build''
    and start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
