  m_text: "Once everything is set up, (re)start the Archipelago Launcher and you
    should be able to find a new 'HITMAN World of Assassination Client'. Do NOT open
    HITMAN yet, you'll need to run \"PeacockPatcher.exe\" and \"Start Server.cmd\"
    first. \n\nThen, start the game and you can go back to the AP Launcher, start
    the HITMAN Client and connect there! You might need to restart the game if the
    Archipelago tab doesn't show up in 'Campaign'."
