  m_text: 'Your Super Mario 64 ROM must be in ''.z64'' format and be either a US
    (American) or a Japan copy.

    If your ROM says Japan, it will not be valid
    if it''s also ''Shindou Edition''.


    Once you have selected a valid ROM file,
    do NOT move it from where it is located. (Until you have finished the setup).'
