  m_text: 'You have 2 revert options, both can''t be enabled at the same time.


    If
    you use the "Clear AP Mods" option it will only delete the mods that are required
    for Fez Archipelago.


    If you use the "Full Clear HAT" option it will delete
    everything related to HAT and mods. If other mods are detected an additionnal
    confirmation will appear.'
