  m_text: 'When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, the AP Mod folder will
    then be downloaded into the game''s core files.

    Downloading the mods will
    place them inside already existing folders but it can be reverted (check revert
    infos).'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
