      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, launch the game and go to "mods", click ''Unsafe
    Mods'' to enable it and then click the ''Archipelago'' button to enable it too.
    Then go to, ''Options'', ''Mod Settings'' and click the ''Archipelago'' dropdown.


    In
    the "Server" field, enter "archipelago.gg".


    In the "Port" field, enter
    the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating
    a new room.


    In "Slot", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The
    "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally,
    you can start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
