  m_text: "Once everything is set up, a new console window (separated from the actual
    game) should open when launching the game.\n\nOnce in-game, press ESCAPE, then,
    F10 and type \"/connect archipelago.gg:XXXXX [slotname]\"\n\nXXXXX is the room\u2019s
    port. You can find this number on the website after creating a new room.\n\n\"[slotname]\"
    is the name assigned to your yaml file.\n\nFinally, you should see a text saying
    that you're connected and you can now go back to your game and start a new save!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
