  m_text: 'When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, pvzr.apworld will be
    installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago Launcher
    directory. MelonLoader will then be installed into the game''s core folder. Both
    required dlls will be installed inside the PVZ Replanted\Mods directory.

    Only
    the Mods folder will be created automatically, the other ones will be created
    after starting the game.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
