  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, press ''F5'' in the main menu, a new window
    should appear. Go to the ''Archipelago/Connection'' tab.


    In the "Server
    IP/Address" field, enter "archipelago.gg".


    In the "Server Port" field,
    enter the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after
    creating a new room.


    In "Player/Slot Name", enter the name assigned to
    your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set
    one, leave it blank.


    Click ''Save Preferences'' on top of the window, go
    to the ''Archipelago'' tab and enable Archipelago by clicking the box and save
    again. Finally, restart the game and then you should be able to connect by pressing
    the 1st button on the main menu.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
