  m_text: 'When you click "START SETUP" in the SETUP tab, peak.apworld will be installed
    and moved into the custom_worlds folder within the Archipelago Launcher directory.

    BepInEx
    will then be downloaded into the PEAK game directory, along with the PeakArchipelago
    folder, which will be placed in plugins.'
