  m_text: "Once everything is set up, select a fresh new save with no Archipelago
    data and once you press 'Accept' a new Archipelago connection window should appear.\n\nEnter
    archipelago.gg:XXXXX in the \"Server\" field, where XXXXX is the room\u2019s
    port. You can find this number on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIn
    \"Slot Name\", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe \"Password\"
    field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, click
    \"Connect\" and then, you can start playing!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
